      "item": "6A2: Strategic Plan Development Update",
      "body": "Staff briefly reported that a public survey of the top 20 objectives from the comprehensive plan would be released in October, asking the public to rank their top 10 priorities to help narrow the strategic plan to 10 objectives. The survey will be published online. No vote was taken."
