      "item": "Year-to-Date Budget Report",
      "body": "Finance staff reported that the payroll benchmark for the period is 46.74%. All three departments — CPZ, Parks/Forestry/Recreation, and Solid Waste — are below that benchmark on expenditures. CPZ is at 59.5% of revenue budget and 35.27% of expenditure budget. Parks is at 53.79% of revenue and 30.9% of expenditure. Solid Waste is at 29.84% of revenue and 26.8% of expenditure, with low revenue figures attributed to use of fund balance transfer for new landfill cell construction. No concerns were flagged."
    },
